{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>游嘉欣陷入「變臉」疑雲 IG 連環出 Post 揭真相 圖/ kayan_yau IG</p><p>無綫小花 游嘉欣 （游游）憑藉甜美外貌與率真性格，近年備受無綫重用。不過隨著曝光率大增，有眼利網民指她近年的五官比剛出道時更為精緻。面對網上的紛紛擾擾，游游日前選擇於個人 Instagram（ IG ）連環發文並貼出多張對比照，親自揭開「變臉」背後的真相！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c6b1cd741a2d619483616c9b6478a910a5dea7501895627a9070c986261c6b26/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-20-at-110244-am_3391.png\"/><p>面對「變臉」傳聞，游嘉欣沒有避諱，反而於 IG 限時動態及貼文連環圖文並茂地回應。她上載了多張角度極為真實的無濾鏡素顏照以及中學時代舊照，證明自己的五官「純天然零加工」。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/09e94d1027c69f94fda164e87d1571e3dd18ee23a4fe26cae3a33f4ba85f7bb0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-20-at-110256-am_1605.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2c2d99d30d6c74992df47fcfe01dfe416146698657974031227cf8970bc850d1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-20-at-110301-am_3193.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c1ec6c2d00451dd7574c3fa35e85ec31ea25289d3c32d7041c81c335078585ae/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-20-at-110307-am_0103.png\"/><p>游嘉欣突附上中學相一張 圖/ kayan_yau IG</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/741a9392c84323a735ac77df7be5263c46a7e387b3738919f7b52e0215cf40e3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-20-at-110320-am_1417.png\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T06:39:50.839546+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":5,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}